 "system": "b2_nonadaptive",
 "transcript": [
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Hello, I'm here to help you get ready for your appointment. Could you tell me what has been bothering you?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "Can't sleep."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "When did you first start having trouble sleeping?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "About three months ago."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Do you have any allergies, or have you ever had a bad reaction to a medicine?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "No allergies that I know of."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "On a scale from 0 to 10, how bad is your trouble sleeping these days?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "Seven out of ten."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Could you tell me what medicines you take these days, including any new ones or ones you’ve changed, and how much you take if you know?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "I take losartan for my blood pressure."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Besides your blood pressure, do you have any other health problems that have lasted a long time?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "My prostate's enlarged."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "What else do you notice when you're having trouble sleeping?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "Wake at 3 or 4, can't get back to sleep."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "When you wake up at 3 or 4 and can’t get back to sleep, what do you notice?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "Mood's been a bit low since I retired."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Is there anything you do that helps you get back to sleep when you wake up at 3 or 4?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "A long walk during the day helps."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "When you're lying awake, where do you notice it most — mostly in your body, mostly in your thoughts, or are you not sure?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "Not sure really. My daughter's been worried about me."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "What would you most like the doctor to help you with?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "I want proper sleeping tablets."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "When you can't sleep, what does that feel like for you?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "Just exhausted all day."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "You mentioned an enlarged prostate — is there anything else from your past health you’d like the doctor to know about?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "That's about it, really."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Besides losartan, is there anything else you take, like other medicines, vitamins, or anything you’ve recently started or changed?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "I've been taking those sleep tablets from the pharmacy."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "You mentioned your mood has been a bit low since retiring — is there anything else you've noticed or would like to add?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "No, no thoughts of harming myself."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Is there anything else you’ve noticed with your sleep trouble that you’d like to add?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "I doze off in the chair in the afternoon."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Thank you, that is very helpful. I have put together a short summary of what you told me. Please read it and tell me if anything should be corrected before it goes to your doctor."
  }
 ],
